'''Growth Spurt''' (食べ盛り育ち盛り, ''Tabezakari Sodachizakari'', '''Eating a Lot and Growing a Lot''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (M): Wallet size is increased by 20%.

